      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">TMDHosting VPS Review 2026: Managed cPanel from $69/mo</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-base">Last updated: August 18, 2026 · 14 min read</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-gray-300 leading-relaxed space-y-5">

      <p>TMDHosting has been in the web hosting business since <strong>2007</strong> — that's nearly two decades of operating managed Linux VPS with cPanel/WHM as its flagship product. In an industry where smaller hosts come and go, that runway matters: customers can stack a real track record of uptime, support quality, and product evolution against newer entrants. We dug into TMDHosting's 2026 line-up — the AMD EPYC + NVMe hardware refresh, the 8+ global data centers, the all-included cPanel/WHM+CloudLinux+SSL+WAF stack — and compared it to the rest of our <a href="/vps" class="text-orange-400 hover:underline">VPSTier-covered managed providers</a>.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-4">TMDHosting at a Glance</h2>
      <p>TMDHosting is a managed-Linux-VPS specialist with one product line built around <strong>cPanel/WHM</strong>, CloudLinux, and AMD EPYC. The company does not chase every developer niche: there is no GPU tier, no custom-ISO image uploads, no bare-metal reclaim option. The value proposition is squarely "cPanel-managed VPS, with the license, security, and support all bundled into one flat monthly bill."</p>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
        <li><strong>Founded:</strong> 2007 (verified from tmdhosting.com About page footer: "TMDHosting © est. 2007")</li>
        <li><strong>Niche:</strong> Managed cPanel/WHM Linux VPS (also shared hosting, WordPress, WooCommerce, dedicated servers)</li>
        <li><strong>Hardware stack:</strong> AMD EPYC CPUs on every plan, NVMe SSD storage, KVM virtualization, 100% dedicated RAM</li>
        <li><strong>Software stack:</strong> cPanel/WHM, CloudLinux, Apache HTTP/2 + HTTP/3 + QUIC, Litespeed (16GB+ plans), PHP 5.6 – 8.5, MariaDB 11.4, Softaculous</li>
        <li><strong>Datacenters:</strong> 8+ global — Chicago, London, Amsterdam, Singapore, Sydney, Tokyo, Johannesburg, Mumbai</li>
        <li><strong>SLA:</strong> 99.99% uptime guarantee</li>
        <li><strong>Support:</strong> 24/7/365 human monitoring, included on every tier</li>
        <li><strong>Entry plan:</strong> Managed cPanel 4GB at $69/mo (paid monthly)</li>
      </ul>

